# Offline Master Model & Ice Hockey Screener Integration Plan

Upgrade the **PulseOdds Sports Screener** application by integrating the **Offline Master Model — Multi-Sport Odds & Lines Analysis Framework** across all sports, and adding the **Ice Hockey Screener** to replace its "Coming Soon" status on the homepage.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Key Architectural Decisions & Principles**
> 1. **Zero-AI / Zero-Feed Guarantee**: The entire framework operates strictly offline on user-entered decimal odds and lines. No external data feeds or LLM inferences are used.
> 2. **Additive Confluence Layer**: The Offline Master Model's Confluence Ledger acts as a **read-only aggregation and cross-validation layer**. It does not overwrite or modify existing MET, MEG, TTC, PGD, TGD, or CSI calculations.
> 3. **Non-Merged Dual Metrics**: Output displays will show both **Market Probability %** (raw de-vigged bookmaker price) and **Confluence Tier** (Tier 1/2/3/No Read consistency level) side-by-side without inflating probabilities.
> 4. **Hard Conflict Cap**: Any explicit disagreement between cross-market checks (e.g. BTTS vs Over/Under, Dual Tiebreak discrepancy, or Shutout vs Moneyline) hard-caps the verdict at **Tier 3 — Conflicted**.

