## Proposed Changes

### 1. Engine Core & Math Layer (`src/lib/engine.ts`)

#### [MODIFY] [engine.ts](file:///c:/Users/OMALE%20DANJUMA%20OGALE/Downloads/SELECTION%20SCREENER/Sports-Screener/src/lib/engine.ts)
- Add `SportId = 'football' | 'basketball' | 'tennis' | 'rally' | 'hockey'` type definition.
- **Ice Hockey Engine Implementation**:
  - `createHockeyScopes()`: Regular Time (`rt`) and 1st Period (`p1`) scope state builder with standard line dropdown baselines (Game Total 3.5–9.5, Team Totals 0.5–5.5, Puck Line -3.5–3.5).
  - `analyzeHockey()`: Overtime Intelligence (1X2 regulation draw P(OT), Moneyline-incl-OT split check under coinflip assumption), CS Reconciliation (Odd/Even%, BTTS%, Team xG, Shutout%), Team Goal Differential (TGD), Period 1 Scale Check (P1 × 3 vs RT MEG), Empty-Net Reversal (lopsided Moneyline as Over signal), and Profiles A/B/C/D.
- **Master Model Confluence Ledger & Verdict Engine**:
  - Implement `ConfluenceLedger` interface & builder per sport:
    - **Football**: Primary Scope (FT Profile A/B) + Cross-Scope (2H/1H) + Cross-Market (BTTS-vs-Total) + Scoreline Structure (Resistance Zone 5–6 / 7–8 / 12–13.5 bands) + Profile D Corroboration.
    - **Basketball**: Primary Scope (FT Profile A/B) + Cross-Scope (Scale Check Q1×4 / 1H×2) + Cross-Market (TTC diff) + Handicap Width Structure + Profile D Corroboration.
    - **Tennis**: Primary Scope (RT Profile A/B) + Cross-Scope (S1×2.4/4.1) + Cross-Market (PGD / Dual-Tiebreak signal) + Structural (CSI vs MEG expected games) + Profile D Corroboration.
    - **Table Tennis (Rally)**: Primary Scope (Full Match O/U) + Cross-Scope (1st Set 4.3× projection) + Cross-Market (Individual Player Totals consistency) + Structural (Match Shape Sweep/4-set/5-set vs Total Sets) + Ranking Corroboration.
    - **Ice Hockey**: Primary Scope (RT Profile A/B) + Cross-Scope (P1×3 Period Scale Check) + Cross-Market (TGD) + Structural (CS Reconciliation Shutout/BTTS) + Empty-Net/Moneyline Balance Corroboration.
  - Implement Tier sorting: **Tier 1 (High)** -> **Tier 2 (Moderate)** -> **Tier 3 (Single-Angle or Conflicted)** -> **No Read**. Candidates ranked by Tier first, Market Probability second, Margin % third.

